# Paths that need the owner's eyes before merging.
#
# This is the platform-side half of the merge gate. bin/hooks/riprap/claude/block-unreviewed-merge.sh
# refuses to merge these; CODEOWNERS makes the forge request a review the moment a
# matching PR opens, so the gate holds even if no agent is involved.
#
# GOTCHA — CODEOWNERS uses gitignore-style matching, which tests a pattern against a
# single path segment unless the pattern is directory-anchored. `**/*billing*` matches a
# FILE with billing in its name, but NOT a file that merely lives inside a directory
# called billing (src/billing/handler.ts). Every keyword therefore needs both a filename
# glob and a `/**` directory glob. Getting this wrong makes the gate look configured
# while covering half of what you think it covers.
#
# The team named below must have write access to the repository, or GitHub silently
# ignores every rule here — the same failure this file's own gotcha warns about.

# The guardrail machinery itself — a change here can disable everything else.
/bin/hooks/**            @influpert/code-reviewers
/.claude/settings.json   @influpert/code-reviewers
/.github/workflows/**    @influpert/code-reviewers
/.github/CODEOWNERS      @influpert/code-reviewers

# Dependencies: the classic supply-chain vector.
package.json             @influpert/code-reviewers
package-lock.json        @influpert/code-reviewers
requirements.txt         @influpert/code-reviewers
Gemfile.lock             @influpert/code-reviewers
go.sum                   @influpert/code-reviewers
Cargo.lock               @influpert/code-reviewers

# Money, identity, access.
**/*auth*                @influpert/code-reviewers
**/*auth*/**             @influpert/code-reviewers
**/*session*             @influpert/code-reviewers
**/*session*/**          @influpert/code-reviewers
**/*token*               @influpert/code-reviewers
**/*token*/**            @influpert/code-reviewers
**/*payment*             @influpert/code-reviewers
**/*payment*/**          @influpert/code-reviewers
**/*billing*             @influpert/code-reviewers
**/*billing*/**          @influpert/code-reviewers
